<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea grains/oilseeds tender results for October.</title>
<headline>S.Korea grains/oilseeds tender results for October.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea bought at least 220,400 tonnes of grains and oilseeds through tenders and private negotiations during October.</p>
<p>These comprised 52,500 tonnes of corn, 51,400 tonnes of U.S. wheat, 51,000 tonnes of U.S. soybean, 52,000 tonnes of feed wheat, 12,000 tonnes of Chinese cottonseed meal and 1,500 tonnes of Canadian mixed feed oats.</p>
<p>The total figure compares with total purchases of 895,000 tonnes in September.</p>
